From 1586f7bf6d6e57a4d5d36cb0968b5b710c0f36dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:44:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Travel: jewellery teleports (games necklace, dueling, glory, 
 skills, combat)

Rub opens the teleport menu (interface 187 via script 217 with hotkeys, as
OSRS and RuneLite's Better Teleport Menu expect) and the worn destination
ops teleport directly, for the games necklace, ring of dueling, amulet of
glory, skills necklace and combat bracelet. Each use takes a charge with the
wiki's messages ("You rub the necklace...", "Your games necklace has seven
uses left.", "...crumbles to dust."); the glory, skills necklace and combat
bracelet keep an uncharged item. Destinations and tiles from the wiki, in
dbtables jewellery_teleport_items/dests. Integration tests for the charges.
